  "description": "Internal alterations comprising:\n1.Removal of the existing partition walls dividing the entry hall and the kitchen to create an extended dining space and cooking area. \n2.Removal of the en-suite bathroom and the partition walls in the guest bedroom together with a new partition wall and door to this bedroom from the hallway. \n3.A new partition wall between the guest bedroom and the master bedroom to facilitate the creation of a walk-in closet associated with latter. This includes the creation of an opening from the master-bedroom into the walk-in closet. \n4.The repositioning of partition walls in the master-bedroom and its en-suite bathroom to enable the enlargement and re-configuration of the adjoining guest bathroom. This also involves the en-suite bathroom in the master bedroom being re-configured and refurbished.\n5.The reconfiguration of the hallway and central circulation of the flat. This involves the removal of the partition wall between the living room and the hallway and the repositioning of the partition wall between the master bedroom and the corridor\n",
